# Policy: all analysis runs local. Only BUY/SELL results are published.
#
# publish_to_github.sh runs `git add -A`, so anything that lands in this
# folder gets pushed to a PUBLIC repo. This is an allowlist, not a
# blocklist: ignore everything, then name the files that may go out.
# A stray panel.parquet, bhavcopy CSV or pipeline .py copied here is
# ignored by default instead of published by default.
*
!.gitignore
!.nojekyll
!README.md
!index.html

# Streamlit Cloud entry point + its deps
!streamlit_app.py
!requirements.txt
!.devcontainer/
!.devcontainer/devcontainer.json

# The results themselves
!stocks_in_trend_summary.txt
!positions.json
!bulk_deals.csv
